        "text": "Gentle reminder:\n\nBlock out time away from the screen.\n\nForce yourself if you have to.\n\nRead a book for once. Hit the coffee shop. Do anything that gives your mind space to process all of the noise you've accumulated.\n\nYou will feel the immense difference in mental clarity."
