          "like_count": 3,
          "quote_count": 1,
          "reply_count": 2,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "没有物质基础，是没办法愉快地做科研的。"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1958735760225705984",
        "created_at": "2026-08-25T11:27:03.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
